{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "עשר אעשרנו", :translit "aser e'esrenu", :gloss "a tenth I will surely tithe"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :gematria, :a "עשר אעשרנו", :b "וזהו כל המבזבז אל יבזבז יותר מחומש"}], :frame {:text "The practice of tithing one's wealth for charity is linked to the rabbinic guideline that one should not give away more than a fifth of one's assets, so as not to impoverish oneself. This limit is articulated in Ketubot 50a and is codified as normative halakhah in Shulchan Arukh, Yoreh De'ah 249:1. Jacob's pledge to tithe thus aligns with the standard measure of charitable giving.", :sources ["Ketubot 50a" "Shulchan Arukh Yoreh De'ah 249:1"]}}], :arithmetic [{:kind :gematria, :a "עשר אעשרנו", :a-value 1197, :b "וזהו כל המבזבז אל יבזבז יותר מחומש", :b-value 1206, :lens :standard, :by :selah, :equal? false}], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :discipline "bht-chalkboard-v1", :timestamp "2026-07-12T23:08:53.470255898Z", :model "glm-5.2"}